## Environment Variables (document in README)

| Variable | Purpose |
|----------|---------|
| `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL` | Canonical base URL (placeholder until domain chosen) |
| `CONTACT_API_URL` | Nest contact endpoint (frontend) |
| `RESEND_API_KEY` / SMTP | Email delivery (backend only) |
| `CONTACT_TO_EMAIL` | Inbox for form submissions |
